const TUT_STEPS = [
  ["Welcome to Genesis One", "You have just landed at Solport, in the Stellar Aviation FBO. Your bag is on the carousel beside you. Follow the green carpet and the EXIT signs through the building to step out onto the site. W A S D to walk, mouse to look."],
  ["You are on the land", "This is the real 430 acres. Sky, the tour guide, is right here at the door and will walk you through everything. Press E near anything with a prompt. The compass at the top shows where the hubs are."],
];
const TUT_CARDS = [["The Landing", "Stage 01. Two ring roads of desert-modern homes around the clubhouse, the grand pavilion, the chapel and Founders Row, where you can buy a lot."], ["The Flight Line", "Stage 02. Hangars along the north side of the 6,000 ft runway, hangar homes behind, the diner and the terminal. Every hangar opens: walk up and press E."], ["The Expanse", "Stage 03. Everything south of the runway: Main Street, the Design District gallery walk, the Commons glamping village, Lakeside and Desert Golf."], ["Earn and spend", "You earn GB coins for time on the site and for minigames. Spend them on outfits at the General Store, meals at the diner, art at the gallery, and lots on Founders Row."], ["Ranks", "Passenger, Pilot, Captain, Tower. Collect Sol Passport stamps, meet the partners, fly, play and visit daily to move up; press J for your passport and how to rank up. Ranks are earned by play only and show on your name."], ["Play", "Desert Golf (nine holes), the Cart Course, the Drag Strip, the Sky Obby, Sky Rings, the Founders Cache and the Lake Lap all keep leaderboards (L). Press C for a cart, space to jump."], ["Talk", "Enter to chat with people near you, V for voice within 60 m, G to sign the guestbook."], ["Landing", "Line up with the runway at the site, ease off W, let the speed drop under 150 km/h and settle. Press F to step out at the tower."]];
